# How School Librarians Use Social Media to Stay on Top of Issues and Trends as Digital Leaders

**Authors:** Nikki Robertson-Griffin

## Abstract
Schools (and some librarians) relegated librarians to the &quot;business of books&quot; and disregarded them of proven technological expertise. Fortunately, school librarians have either continued to insert themselves into digital technologies or emerged from the stacks to reclaim their role as digital resource experts in their schools. So, how do school librarians stay on top of issues and trends as digital leaders? For many, social media platforms help address this question.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ1438992

